cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, the archived random signatures or the result tables, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "Sepsis blood transcriptomic signature benchmark: analysis code, archived random signatures and results"
abstract: "Code, input data, archived random signatures and result tables for a benchmark of 36 published sepsis prognostic gene signatures against random signatures built with a common modelling pipeline, with analyses of leukocyte composition and of the dependence of endotyping labels on batch composition."
